  "description": "DEMOLITION AND REBUILT FOR 4 FLATS",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The application fails to provide a minimum of 35% of dwellings as family sized units (3 or more bedrooms), contrary to Policy D6 of the London Plan and Policy HO1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "Car parking cannot be satisfactorily provided within the curtilage of the site to meet the Council&#x27;s requirements in respect of the development, and the likely increase in parking on the neighbouring highway(s) would be detrimental to the free flow and safety of traffic on the neighbouring highway(s), contrary to Policy T6 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy M2 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).",
    "Insufficient information has been provided regarding the impact of the proposals on designated heritage assets to enable a full assessment of the impact of the proposals on important heritage features, contrary to Policy HC1 of the London Plan and Policies SP02 and HE1 of Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041)",
    "&lt;p&gt;Insufficient information has been provided to allow the Local Planning Authority to fully and accurately assess the impact of the proposals on neighbouring trees, contrary to Policy G7 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy G14 of Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041)&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
